    "average": "Arithmetic mean in Float32 of the two stored Float16 sigmoid heatmaps, then Float16, before thresholding or peak extraction. No max/union, labels, or case-specific choices.",
    "inference": "Frozen checkpoint, CPU batch one, one thread, same original RGB/validity. Second mask is exactly 1-original. Use the existing infer helper unchanged.",
